# orun per-job staged workspaces and object-model caches.
#
# `**/` because a pattern containing a slash is anchored to THIS directory,
# so the root-anchored form missed `testing/rehearsal/.orun/` — an intent
# that lives in a subdirectory caches beside itself, and a `plan` run there
# offered 40 content-addressed blobs to the next `git add -A`.
**/.orun/runs/
**/.orun/

